---
module: alerts
func_id: escalate-alerts
---

***conformance tests***

# t8-escalation
T8: an unacknowledged RED Alert escalates to the coordinator after 15 minutes.

# acknowledged-not-escalated
A `NURSE` :Alert: acknowledged with `POST /alerts/{id}/ack` before 15 minutes pass is not escalated, and no `COORDINATOR` :Alert: has its `assessmentId`.
